abstract: >-
  Measurement records, calibration, analysis code and figure scripts for daemonic work
  extraction from a transmon quantum battery on IBM Quantum Phoenix, where the residual
  ZZ coupling to four neighbouring transmons provides the measurement record and a
  real-time controller selects the extraction pulse.
keywords:
  - quantum batteries
  - daemonic ergotropy
  - measurement-based feedback
  - superconducting qubits
  - residual ZZ coupling
  - quantum thermodynamics
